  "_source_stem": "Acushnet2024",
  "_notes": "Fairhaven Neighborhood News, Thursday 23 May 2024, page 8, \"Fewer than 500 vote in Acushnet Election\" by Beth David -- an outlet with no prior row anywhere in this corpus. 498 ballots of 8,573 registered (5.8%); NO CONTESTED RACES. THREE SEATS DREW NO CANDIDATE and are recorded here rather than as zero-vote candidates: Commissioner of Trust Funds x2 (one full term, one remainder of an unexpired term) and Trustee of the Free Public Library x1. The source reports no blanks or write-in totals, so every count is bounded by the 498 ballots but no race can be closed against it. Acushnet's annual reports always print the full precinct-level return; the 2024 report is not yet published and should supersede this when it is.",
